    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Getaway Storm</strong>\u00a0is a simple fun arcade racing game that quickly turns into online multiplayer chaos with friends! Surviving for as long as you can is a team effort, since anyone getting wrecked is a game over for everyone. Let's see how fast you can go and how long you can last. \ud83d\ude0e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online multiplayer with 1-5 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arcade handling/drifting physics that are just built different \ud83d\ude0e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Audio Drive mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 sus cars to unlock and drive \ud83d\ude33 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of car crashes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highscore and replay system with different categories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weekly and Daily online leaderboards</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Getaway Storm</strong>\u00a0is a simple fun arcade racing game that quickly turns into online multiplayer chaos with friends! Surviving for as long as you can is a team effort, since anyone getting wrecked is a game over for everyone. Let's see how fast you can go and how long you can last. \ud83d\ude0e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online multiplayer with 1-5 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arcade handling/drifting physics that are just built different \ud83d\ude0e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Audio Drive mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 sus cars to unlock and drive \ud83d\ude33 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of car crashes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highscore and replay system with different categories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weekly and Daily online leaderboards</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Survive the fast, chaotic roads with your friends! Or experience your favorite music in the Audio Drive mode. The audio affects the environment and speed.",
